    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Terra is a a science fiction First Person Shooter/Role Playing Game. Pave the way for mankind's resettlement on its new Earth, Terra, while fighting relentless machines hellbent on stopping you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight a moltitude of drones, droids, robots, tanks, turrets whose sole objective is to make it all impossible. Collect permanent bonuses and power ups. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore near infinite procedurally generated maps and level layouts for a playthrough that is never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your weapons and gear with credits looted on the missions. Buy permanent upgrades in the base. Earn clearance to access new parts of the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique tiles sets overall, paired with 2-4 different texture sets each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character progression system that is exponential. You get more Skill Points the more you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable parts of the base with more shops for you to buy goodies at.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biochips that add to your basic stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An equipment upgrade system that not only adds to, but also multiplies your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Points earned by finishing missions and used to purchase special permanent upgrades around the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different Powers that add variety to the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/4b00781c3b1e07d4fe782aeaa98e7a9b.avif?t=1755070286\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation Terra is a a science fiction First Person Shooter/Role Playing Game. Pave the way for mankind's resettlement on its new Earth, Terra, while fighting relentless machines hellbent on stopping you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1cd1404af2446b297f8d52faf3a14ab8.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight a moltitude of drones, droids, robots, tanks, turrets whose sole objective is to make it all impossible. Collect permanent bonuses and power ups. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/6a7acec4086940cddb78531e04d2a2a9.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore near infinite procedurally generated maps and level layouts for a playthrough that is never the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.poster.avif?t=1755070286\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.webm?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/1504529ea1957262af012447e96af062.mp4?t=1755070286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Upgrade your weapons and gear with credits looted on the missions. Buy permanent upgrades in the base. Earn clearance to access new parts of the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique tiles sets overall, paired with 2-4 different texture sets each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character progression system that is exponential. You get more Skill Points the more you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable parts of the base with more shops for you to buy goodies at.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biochips that add to your basic stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An equipment upgrade system that not only adds to, but also multiplies your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Points earned by finishing missions and used to purchase special permanent upgrades around the base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different Powers that add variety to the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593740/extras/4b00781c3b1e07d4fe782aeaa98e7a9b.avif?t=1755070286\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p>",
